{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1351,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:713c649598f7b0231cd3035c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd43eb7f1402ebdd316438b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1517fbd3c7a4b1a9bc6c0f2a21ca4dcc3ad0db20e4ce267cdba0767e3af1e843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ced15e673e17ee04a491b0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘁……",
      "source_fingerprint": "231bd8432a25649cced553794e75413aeb492be446e8e52f9238e401473e6102",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e40f0defb675c9774a961765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "da93b25d94967d580b8f3daeeca7c854d6a49a2af2dd938326605638c724f895",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e79435be65deb7815eb89a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼嗯……明天是这个呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde55e1426e683e4cbb3896f4e80abf08893ea52f4a87728f9fa377451a15ed9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7cfd4718c990f01aade2c1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……脚……好重……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc696112e1f801ae973a613c47f2be153f8a9e6919950bb14841a41ae205839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4bd850ae3c5f70b13e68db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说了，我一点都不累……！\n这种程度而已，根本不值一提！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cf7d2ce90c462f3ba808af739bb2acb3e5374e085cfab39e957bb9fb0b039e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:183fd2d6e8d4ed965a102fd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。准备已经做好了。\n赶紧开干吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d4d9b842c776e1e906ee2ac7f3cae1e6a7573a39101552bab4d592214dbfda9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b7e4505ce80302ddc38c29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态？我状态很好啊。\n嘛，对我而言算很好就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69ce5a5958257bbb5378a539a8be450661c742ff0277b003cbc91ca15ddc225",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38baf7e03a0b94bf01fc7cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，现在是得硬着头皮上了。\n我没做好的地方，待会记得告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40fa6168d72986ae34f3ae743b3c377daad5817fc5f2131bac33cc3d549c601",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296f592ad8965ec0891ec2b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点把训练菜单给我吧。\n记得给我安排比其他人强度更大的训练…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e9ef896135aaae3eebca8fadb4ade54e01ada9113cbed0ae3a784b1d2351c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea052fd1adf07ab360a1193c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……然后呢？\n按照平时那种感觉来就行吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "844a6befcf6b5bc02452281aa961824d9568297017991f23956de56a348cce78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:becdd27f12f73a336d9e1e0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你在做什么呢？\n训练菜单，有好好考虑吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee1763974c311d0e482dcc212716b671722118c42a18886762165c4b45006076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7d28e21da53a4dfd5450879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姑且试试看好了。\n可别抱太大期待啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e655ad16c25d02821ef21aefa540d54af292d08b7bb913e64f901a4c5d046d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5532dd40eeb079b216806713",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然感觉不太好……\n但训练我还是会好好做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c345b688e66a2f3ace3b7551169f05260730fccd370076e5d7da44cb5127a17f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ba5416091662ddbdf066e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……在这种状态下训练，\n能有什么收获呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f472e9b0fb42475012ecbb9b796236275325d13c9facc02874404d7a22e3285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8210ea21b90d80d8af6f64f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…啊～该死。\n现在可不是该生闷气的时候啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3448fb6faf3bd4e017c435bc64b0ce1101f88bcd56a92a88b04fcaf9f84a5b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1284d4ed72e19cc3921b6877",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又是比赛啊……没事，\n我会参加的。\n之后休息下应该就没事了……应该。",
      "source_fingerprint": "908c7b16b2b7b09160bc0c27f311521c002d31b26fb9692660f97fa167559834",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732fcd70b18b325761deec72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……必须参加更多比赛，\n拿下更多胜利才行……\n我才没在发牢骚啊……哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b243df32f9f6bbcc180ba22f6e7096d7dd0c346da2a1fb935deae8243b3a8639",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64b5e9531d8d190dff0c0bab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，感觉还不赖。\n现在的话，不管是什么样的大块头，\n我都不会输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3512abd787c2c8f92e9e0d0d33426c8bed46dde52755679d3d9cd0c878a2846b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bfe407799beeb88813096b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体调整得很棒。\r\n接下来就是抓住冲刺的时机——\r\n……凭这末脚的话，一定不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01b1347c0076d407c9af9034c02083446ee1ebef32192e5a3bbdb3a0429770fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce866e0b2c0de5bdd4c98a36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要让所有观众都大吃一惊……\n将我奔跑的模样，\n烙在他们眼底……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a072c9b21eaefa0dfb1e356f2a411a3a78e13ac68d48237e5a2df1ad4d1da87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:213de3f1b3b11ffa36cdce2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，还没开始比赛嘛？\n想趁着还有感觉的时候尽快开跑啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba26dee1a67bc98620b87b6da7c91a2dabbf54ce43e7af1a121f5e3ee7e9741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fd1c9ceca3165adeb033730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照这个状态的话，\n你稍微期待一下今天的比赛也可——\n不，没什么。忘了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f90933d6cce35794cee11424724b66f286b9ed32cac3e3e304476d3ab27730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:629474782e377934b3060b42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，准备完成……你笑过头啦。\n虽然身体的调整确实不错，\n但要高兴的话，还是留到比赛之后吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "823650ec48304b6ee3b6d92937d2a86481f74337eb59f45f28e1b971c487fa63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:117dadb34b415f33b850c5a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，要上了。\r\n我要把我的名字……\r\n刻在所有人脑袋里……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fa47ff93df82d31c5d06d6146a91191e2a817642c1c664398c4a7e4fe8f3ad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ccaeacabb497959f0500865",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么比赛都一样。\n我只要超越所有人就好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07e9025248fac6039a05ffbaea49e16a4e68173566f244aaac2a1675c1574b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc73c30a658d72fad0b97853",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态？还行吧。\n之后按照练习的时候来就行了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08853846a7abe8386c9c479453a13ff3bb556d9cd463d9f5fd82c4ae9d245675",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a4b0f6cdcb6b420bb2e84b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经要开始比赛了？\n我还以为调整的时间能更长一点……\n没办法，只能上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7784dd2633414823a8fc11b8460b3bbd17e69fa71e37847dcfc794d55d4a2cef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ce64042bbe61f066766b78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经是背水一战了……\n就凭现在的状态，\n能跑多好就跑多好吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee163126c876617f6be95e6fd809857f000790015754d3ce2a20e5abeae2c5b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ea8d549cab09dbbd2a7de8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还留有遗憾，\n但一直说个不停的话就没完了。\n拿出结果来看就好了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "651d4f134843a62d71d90d35df04c4187ed2cf58a72db51e3991475c6e02bc1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2daff95d6bf07536d888770",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算调整得非常糟糕……\n我也绝对要赢给你看！\n我才不想给自己找输掉的借口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "145258f7fe7b3b78a192e1293874a1157b8698d49b40a8eeaf461bd9c06e547d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4908b90f943516c47a494787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名次又不是按照调整的结果来定的。\r\n不到正赛的话，\r\n还不知道结果会怎么样吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b8fadd18d6f7f478bfd803dfcd29857b2ad8c2e071b41a0e2fffacb74c6bb10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2065cd49116feb377958e5e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道我的状态调整简直一团糟……\n但不管什么情况，\n我都必须要赢下来才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b87627ee8115bae3d6d18bd9e3ee16486f93a4ffc4499f5078b7fa2e5faa7ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b09849e90dd87043a305dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "841dbb3110c54559ae821e0128fb5946c7205da0c11593fbc3f80bacf7dbf1a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93cb6042c49ab405711cdbec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4751dd24b1cc01c018d0bfc5e41666107f225b47c76b137af696c4a8217995a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c49148967da770962ee7564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样做对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca27b7aa11d7ec48c21eafd0467888e88e52ae56a1127a764281a3551d971126",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:111659458adc87df073cd9e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21bed79927e5236d335292545e9ebd0f5f41ee49249a49856519a27ee9095c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108e8cb8b7b81fc16add1a6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕……",
      "source_fingerprint": "727c3d354aadc91e3ce724d2a41fcbc84234cc54a17162f2d8758e28db67d1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8df8ba72d2a189757ce1f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搞不明白啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26519768659c78282bb7fd32d7f98170f94e09875873b8a28c988037b0a9522c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dcd4a760d96359456dc9adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "841dbb3110c54559ae821e0128fb5946c7205da0c11593fbc3f80bacf7dbf1a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc69e9067d896c3039c42ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光好刺眼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "06224637b9cc81db046da8f7ccf0d24487dacc2be0cec433e9ded3c74e5274d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3fba3363ea5569525e4105",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮了我这么多……\n姑且向你道个谢吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21eaa57aed23ccc61c26051c82f390ae8784eb62e7a6d8cf52ee161dbe3c63c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2387d9592f2a6f67705a2fcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还以为能做得更好呢……\n嘛，也就这样了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a27d8ca6b153f7a9d1d3e99503adcd647b7d5ec7e1806be41d48007ad3541e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d700a8e3ce2fcc8cc37349fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们关系倒也没那么好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f911468fa53737ff0a2a5f90b7b82ddc047c460c21ed912756f61dba98b552d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e530e25ea5edc35b0edbe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……差不多该走了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "130bd2d0e4736912fb2647ca6ec2b940d3a610963c9e06ad09a09e9a8ab4aefc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4f8855f9247c868a1a0061",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢的是我们啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeabce5feb69356fd95b98a6b0daf0d9f948d0960e12e8417f2cc0ec42a6f379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c8182d66917f1cf2d5b80b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还以为能做得更好呢……\n嘛，也就这样了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a27d8ca6b153f7a9d1d3e99503adcd647b7d5ec7e1806be41d48007ad3541e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cde2ece75f12a96dd3ee58e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，准备完成……你笑过头啦。\n虽然身体的调整确实不错，\n但要高兴的话，还是留到比赛之后吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "823650ec48304b6ee3b6d92937d2a86481f74337eb59f45f28e1b971c487fa63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c80fe786657f17c2e07d057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要让所有观众都大吃一惊……\n将我奔跑的模样，\n烙在他们眼底……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a072c9b21eaefa0dfb1e356f2a411a3a78e13ac68d48237e5a2df1ad4d1da87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e1d81e9758d46ac2f5d8fa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还以为能做得更好呢……\n嘛，也就这样了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a27d8ca6b153f7a9d1d3e99503adcd647b7d5ec7e1806be41d48007ad3541e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c60dadde7d9878e7e6816e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9755a9eabe4fc74b749199976f64552b326ba342d5fe08d1294a0f4c4340e889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9671d1c90dc3497a90195caa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊真是的！\n下次一定要拿下第一……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d72502ad7003dab1172a25209f0d977c3fcfca7dc2b8eb765c7dec423c31894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36ab29d52e8d077ee378de76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够……还得继续变强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc1b0c753f8666f5bb41c8fb0f88327a0cae271776526abe05b84addd5e34f6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2288f9899d9f2b20e05175cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然也不差……\r\n但这种半吊子的成绩毫无意义啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa5f26215f4b7d9080fb760b26a2665d0d807effeb3a04aa6b6c884dfd1c36a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b97bf89005da3364567c036",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该死……！\n这样下去可不行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e519809e202c3c4d8b460ac6d48149c8e442765f53d3731e161345b4480ee50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de800a236fe119f80644a7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼！知道我的实力了吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1471d73f339a9f376951e891560894688b72b3f63538a97e6d603e0f9a2abd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac27f282dda44c99e964314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿……看见了吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13fd5eaa0d2878210fbfe974b11f9122c2633b95ed6b5da3cc0703e863325a03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9066ef61c4e871620ffd3ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎样，看见了吗——这就是我的“调律”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2284482fae944c9ffe9f016417f997954fd35556baa1669a5f12024fe49acc1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:798a990a9f4b8a3e15104fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿……看见了吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13fd5eaa0d2878210fbfe974b11f9122c2633b95ed6b5da3cc0703e863325a03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffa25f65f434e58735923003",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結果が全て！誰にも文句は言わせないっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86bf7a4b62b202f0620d72e46172a4df200997eb3204c4a3b7b0eaac05398e5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b659794fd6c3de019858ee98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へへっ…見たかっての！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a891b5a58b131b3be36e16541aeba0648f1525eddc8e3cdd0cbd725f0397644b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e888f988ee6307c6a312228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会输的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3c88c3e5f00fd6ce5746853af35d774fcb8e1e70d0a13a853c015b03b00116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f9a92abaa6841fe056d2b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会让任何人妨碍我…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "640d5a246f805d8498aa630d3b2cce3d452b8d2779c37e95314d995557cff7c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b8a5e6171e3837a6efda8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明明没告诉妈妈关于广告的事情……\r\n她却给我发了信息……\r\n奖券那家伙……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5152eb11fdaedef35258063d732d7463b5c118523d8535d44c9bc08d2f59631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11d07d003ce5521fbc986ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷……没听奖券的蠢话真是万幸……\n在冻湖上面搭帐篷，听着都蠢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebcfb3d44d6ca92b1f241afe20498a6f68721256bb91b51bd0291c412a58117e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd73b364188ad98b859a0f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チケットのヤツ『タイシンと\r\nハヤヒデどっちを応援したら\r\nいいんだぁぁ！？』って…アホか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "328bbccd7d4f93f65b3a2d7bb7a7ff9814adc93cbe25920f6d53f4cc4af350f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60cfb40c43a314d1c0a7bd4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈…说太多话了。累了…\r\n…能一直喋喋不休，\r\n在某种程度上也算是个才能呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ce6aa4fd559f87b2ec660a6a9141c6a91172dc3ca2e8718bcbb4fda733b9d1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8189e978945a20af1c5f6130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游戏里修理机械的操作画面就是一款解谜游戏。\r\n……还做得挺好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5e81bc101f168218f652e50934cb3cbb01dfc9cca3dc1e42575126037a9cac8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83b6f1869beef1791a9ce3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハヤヒデ倒しといて、負けるとか\r\nないでしょ。あとで何言われるか\r\nわかったもんじゃないんだから…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ace9fc16f80d7230f9699b5a4861df1b2b32b8eff6ac0946752693a2358c838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42be44615742e51f2d5d83cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再快些、再快些！快到谁都追不上我……！\n那些小瞧我、说要让我走着瞧的家伙……\n让我来告诉他们，我的实力是货真价实的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2aab453771e2f0ce9bbf7090a1029fbba15621503435f5bdd682026d0c5170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9bb1089a2404bf3787b604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……看看自己以前的比赛吧……\r\n嗯，偶尔看看吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec6f5afaf4a2b4b62416765e4105c37aaf4a98c9da9b6883afe397f91f8c3189",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a834cf4eeb0dca7daecb4a5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起きたら、クリークさんがやたら\r\n豪華なブランチ作っててさ…。\r\n頼んでないっつの…食べるけど…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53fc247a7b8b61ee4e9ab70be79bfa5a44d244da0ac9b2c9b86a4f6475fa99b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb21aee0cf5e5840e5dfa6a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝着任何人都无法触及的高度……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7f6459d801e587e5014afa31a1e8f54a1a8d011ad24e43ec793527bb9155ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae5f6ddf760306e6d745e1b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……凭我是做不到的？放弃比较好？\r\n别小瞧我了！看我把你们全都甩在身后……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cc3e24ce0653ed6a4562477188285488f4c8f790349c140e83702da5e370ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5a56c3668e65245d0db12db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道あけて！出力全開！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a10cc4adacb99cce2cdeacca9aa2cf68ab42de01ae8d6a6b4353096890f80cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7e06b717989bdd225227a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゲームだろうとなんだろうと\r\nチャンスを掴んで――わからせてやるっ！\r\n…ふんっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52674580b051402dc2b1e251a96683ad2bed6365c832df82911fed109dddc9d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87c23bad62c3eb61c540be7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live啊……反正比赛也赢了，\n我已经很满足了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e20c20120fe06dd79b310178468b9923cf189145d4617da377e161667850f46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a780fd5de293b7b4e8bfc20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……呼………好！\n做给你看看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "594206bacaabfa944a66ba9a21d7b092a35c5d7062a54b87171b560f3fc8c2ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ddc1d1a7e880e1f43fd5844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要不跟过来的话，就把你丢下了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8ff09c439cfe362e64b91fe476c53aaf113e5f4be8efb37d69cde3099df8922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "70000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
